    "text": "Team An interim directory that separates verified identity from details still awaiting confirmation. Home Team Members 01 - Members What can be published now The verified public identity is NKU iGEM 2026 at Nankai University. This is an interim evidence-status page: an authoritative complete member roster has not been located, and approved public display names, verified person-by-person roles, biographies, and public-image permissions have not been confirmed. Member cards are absent because the roster, display names, and roles remain unverified. Photographs are also absent because publication permission was not verified; this does not mean that anyone refused permission. Identity verified NKU iGEM 2026 and Nankai University are supported by the reviewed records. Roster pending One authoritative roster must be confirmed before a complete directory can be published. Names pending Each approved public display name requires a separate confirmation record. Roles pending Broad workstream labels do not establish a person's role or contribution. Biography optional Any biography must be approved and may be omitted without affecting attribution. Images withheld No photograph is shown until its exact file, credit, caption, alt text, and publication permission are confirmed. 02 - Sub-teams Broad workstreams, not a roster The reviewed records organize work into three broad workstreams: Wet Lab, Dry Lab, and Human Practices. These workstreams do not establish person-by-person assignments or membership. Wet Lab Reviewed Wet Lab evidence consists of documented experimental records and attempted workflows. It does not show an end-to-end detector. Dry Lab Dry Lab evidence supports literature research and conceptual computational preparation. No validated model, software, or hardware system is documented. Human Practices Human Practices records include documented education materials and consultation records. They do not establish a completed integrated cycle. 03 - Affiliation Identity and count boundary The team identity is NKU iGEM 2026 at Nankai University. Reviewed internal materials use inconsistent counting conventions, so the numeric team count is withheld and identities are withheld until an authoritative roster and permission record are confirmed. The reviewed partnership invitation is a proposal. It is not a roster, not a role matrix, not an identity permission record, and not a photo permission record. It therefore cannot establish membership, individual roles, image rights, sponsorship, or delivered support. 04 - Thanks Final directory publication gate A final directory entry will require an authoritative roster, an approved public display name, a verified role or contribution, and an optional biography. Any image entry must also identify the exact authorized photo file, caption and alt text, photographer or source credit, and publication permission. The current person-by-work verification status is recorded in Attributions .",
